      "value": "This would be fantastic, though I totally diasgree with using winking as a method to click for a bunch of reasons.\n\nVRC's menu design would need a major overhaul to handle this though, as the current trend of turning everything into endless lists of lists is not good for this kind of input.\n\nOr any kind of input to be honest.",
