      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f2d38467f57433511425209|full_name}: \"wink\" was there mostly as I want the ability to trigger clicks from the outside for flexibility and more options. I agree that it's not the best example, realistically it might be a standalone clicker or some other method like EEG concentration levels, timed long stare, etc.\n\nVRC could change their menu, but if you allowed controller triggers, navigating wouldn't really be any more of an issue than with a controller normally. \n\nWould I like to see it in the future? Sure. But it's by no means a requirement.",
